{"parentUuid":"92d1ce98-6330-45d5-92b9-490f9ab1d091","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"adee29cf670b5c3dc","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01TFQ6WeyS24b9Le7ZAbptL2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完整数据收齐。汇总：\n\n- **Pumpkin**: v0.3.0 PyPI 2026-02-11，py binding 完整（model/variables/constraints/optimisation 全套），有 nqueens/optimisation 示例 + 5 个测试文件\n- **Huub**: develop 最新 2026-05-08，活跃。constraints 列表无 circuit/all_different/no_overlap_2d，有 cumulative/disjunctive/element/table/no_overlap(1D)/linear。**没有 Python binding 文件**——只有 Rust + FlatZinc/MiniZinc CLI\n- **Glasgow**: 2026-05-09 commit 极度活跃，有 gcspy（Python binding），XCSP3 全 v3.2 vocabulary\n\n现在可以输出报告。\n\n---\n\n## Pumpkin\n\n- repo: https://github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin（TU Delft ConSol Lab，**注意之前认知错了，不是 Imperial**）\n- 最近 release: **v0.3.0 / 2026-02-11**（PyPI 同步发布，wheels 覆盖 CPython 3.8-3.14 全平台）\n- Python binding: **正式可用**。`pumpkin-solver-py/` 完整结构（model/variables/constraints/optimisation/brancher）+ nqueens/optimisation 示例 + 5 个 pytest 文件\n- Propagator 状态：cumulative / disjunctive / element / 算术（lin、div、mul、max、abs）/ 子句。**circuit/no_overlap_2d/table/all_different 暂缺**\n- 2025 MiniZinc Challenge fixed-search 铜牌\n- 项目契合：binding 子问题（少量 element + 线性）可做 D''' sidecar；routing/flow 不行（无 circuit）；master 不行（无 no_overlap_2d）\n- ROI：**短期最值得 PoC** —— v0.3 PyPI 已稳，Python API 比上次成熟一档\n\n## Glasgow Constraint Solver\n\n- repo: https://github.com/ciaranm/glasgow-constraint-solver（1263 commits，**2026-05-09 仍每日 commit**）\n- Python binding: **gcspy 已上线** —— `python/gcspy.cc/.hh`（pybind11 风格 C++ 模块），最近还在加 `post_not_equals_reif` 等接口\n- Frontend：XCSP3 full v3.2 vocabulary、MiniZinc 后端、C++ API、Python (gcspy)\n- 招牌特性：**VeriPB 3.0 proof logging** —— 这正是你 D''' sidecar audit 通道的核心需求\n- 状态：作者自己说 \"no stable API\"，C++23（GCC 13+/Clang 21+）门槛较高\n- 项目契合：**proof-logging audit 通道最契合** —— 不替换 main solver，而是对 binding/routing 子问题独立验证\n- ROI：**中期值得做 audit PoC**（不做主求解）—— gcspy 新到位是关键升级\n\n## Huub\n\n- repo: https://github.com/huub-solver/huub（**2026-05-08 commit，极活跃**，DOI 已发，CP 2025 paper《Towards Modern and Modular SAT for LCG》落地）\n- Python binding: **仍然没有**。源码树里没有 `python/`、`*-py/`、pyo3 痕迹。只有 huub-cli + FlatZinc/MiniZinc 接入 + Rust crate\n- Propagator 列表（`crates/huub/src/constraints/`）：bool_array_element、cumulative、disjunctive、int_abs、int_array_element、int_array_minimum、int_div、int_linear、int_mul、int_no_overlap（1D）、int_pow、int_set_contains、int_table、int_unique（=all_different 单值版）、int_value_precede\n- **circuit / no_overlap_2d / flow 仍然没有**（半年前调研结论未变化）\n- 项目契合：master/routing 不行；binding 子问题需走 FlatZinc IPC，不如 Pumpkin 直 Python\n- ROI：**仍是 watchlist**（半年没解锁 Python，没补 circuit/2D/flow）\n\n## verdict\n\n- **半年内值得做 PoC**：**Pumpkin** —— v0.3 PyPI + Python API 成熟，element + 线性 + cumulative 够覆盖 binding 子问题做独立交叉验证\n- **中期 audit PoC 候选**：**Glasgow Constraint Solver** —— gcspy 新到位 + VeriPB proof logging 是 D''' 独立审计的天然契合点；等 API 稳一档\n- **仍 watchlist**：**Huub** —— 没 Python、没 circuit/2D/flow，半年迭代主要在 SAT 模块化（CP 2025 paper 实现）而非外围 propagator\n\n## 路线图 P3 状态建议\n\n- **升级 Pumpkin**：从 P3 watch 升级到 **P2 PoC 候选**（半年内试一次 binding 子问题独立 audit）\n- **升级 Glasgow**：从 P3 watch 升级到 **P2 audit-only 候选**（gcspy 新增是触发条件；不替换 main solver）\n- **Huub 维持 P3**：watchlist，下次复查触发条件 = \"出现 Python binding 或 circuit propagator\"二选一\n\nSources:\n- [ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin](https://github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin)\n- [pumpkin-solver on PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/pumpkin-solver/)\n- [ciaranm/glasgow-constraint-solver](https://github.com/ciaranm/glasgow-constraint-solver)\n- [huub-solver/huub](https://github.com/huub-solver/huub)\n- [Towards Modern and Modular SAT for LCG (Dekker, CP 2025)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42/LIPIcs.CP.2025.42.pdf)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2023,"cache_read_input_tokens":40930,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2023,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_to